WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.390
One message out, every reply back.

00:00:04.614 --> 00:00:07.122
Filter to the agents you mean,

00:00:07.249 --> 00:00:09.060
select all three,

00:00:09.343 --> 00:00:11.248
set the mode to Send,

00:00:11.424 --> 00:00:12.737
write the message once,

00:00:14.284 --> 00:00:15.989
and send it to all three.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.962
Each card shows that its message was sent.

00:00:19.168 --> 00:00:22.252
As each agent answers, its reply appears,

00:00:22.401 --> 00:00:24.029
until all three are in.
